{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EdUcXb5rX5Ee7ULgjf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've addressed it with a first-name placeholder (\"Hi [First name]\"), since a personal greeting helps an apology land. I didn't add any urgency beyond the date and the 52 shares left, because you don't know how fast they'll sell. The email is about 185 words.\n\n<final_document>\nSubject: We got the hail weeks wrong. Here's what's changed.\n\nHi [First name],\n\nOn July 9, hail destroyed about half our crops. For six weeks your box held about half what it should have, and all you got was one short email and no credit. I'm sorry. I was working 16-hour days trying to save what was left, but you deserved better from us.\n\nMost of you who answered our fall survey said you'd come back if we fixed how we handle bad weeks. Here's what we've changed:\n\n- **Credit for short boxes.** If weather cuts a box by more than a third, you get credit for that week.\n- **A weekly update.** I'll email you every Thursday of the season.\n- **Less hail risk.** We spent $31,000 on a second field on higher ground and two hail nets over the tomatoes and peppers.\n- **Pause weeks.** You can pause up to two weeks and get credit for them.\n\nI can't promise we won't lose crops this year. I can promise you won't be left in the dark again.\n\nA full share is still $540. Sign-up closes March 15, and 52 shares are left. You'll find the link on our website.\n\nSam Turner\nGreenbank Farm\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":9787,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":737},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,